    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 119.054, 650.601, 233.415, 662.209 ],
    "heading level" : 3,
    "font" : "Shaker2Lancet-Bold",
    "font size" : 9.5,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Study design and participants"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 5,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 119.054, 606.457, 333.033, 650.188 ],
    "font" : "ScalaLancetPro",
    "font size" : 9.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "We did this three parallel group, randomised controlled trial in Auckland, New Zealand. First randomisation was on Sept 6, 2011, and last follow-up was on July 5, 2013. The published protocol describes procedures in detail."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 6,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 328.975, 610.82, 333.07, 616.189 ],
    "font" : "ScalaLancetPro",
    "font size" : 4.5,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "13"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 7,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 119.05, 496.471, 333.033, 606.19 ],
    "font" : "ScalaLancetPro",
    "font size" : 9.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "In brief, people were eligible if they were aged 18 years or older, had smoked ten or more cigarettes per day for the past year, wanted to stop smoking, and could provide consent. We recruited via community newspapers, inviting people to call the study centre for eligibility prescreening, done by research assistants, who also completed follow-up assessments. We excluded pregnant and breastfeeding women; people using cessation drugs or in an existing cessation programme; those reporting heart attack, stroke, or severe angina in the previous"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 8,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 344.401, 573.484, 558.422, 672.205 ],
    "font" : "ScalaLancetPro",
    "font size" : 9.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "2 weeks; and those with poorly controlled medical disorders, allergies, or other chemical depen dence. Participants were mailed study information, and consent forms to sign and return. The Northern X Regional Ethics Committee approved the study (Number NTX/10/11/111); the Standing Committee on Therapeutic Trials approved the use of nicotine e-cigarettes because they were not permitted for sale in New Zealand, but could be imported for personal use or research."
  }, {
    "type" : "heading",
    "pdfua_tag" : "H3",
    "id" : 9,
    "level" : "Subtitle",
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 344.408, 551.601, 454.361, 563.209 ],
    "heading level" : 3,
    "font" : "Shaker2Lancet-Bold",
    "font size" : 9.5,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Randomisation and masking"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 10,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 344.408, 518.455, 558.428, 551.188 ],
    "font" : "ScalaLancetPro",
    "font size" : 9.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Callers who met the inclusion criteria and gave demographic details and information about nicotine dependence (Fagerström test for nicotine dependence [FTND]"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 12,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 344.404, 496.455, 558.424, 529.188 ],
    "font" : "ScalaLancetPro",
    "font size" : 9.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : ") were randomised by the study statistician (VP) in a 4:4:1 ratio to nicotine e-cigarettes, patches, or placebo"
